error[B0370]: `done_class` performs more than its signature declares
  --> t.beck:117:1
    |
117 | def done_class(t: Todo) -> Str uses log:
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ undeclared: nondet
